","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if this entity is destroyed or lacks one of the components; ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not called then.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The read components are passed as copies, the written ones are changed in place in the nexus (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity\/modify(_:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" receives the read components first, then the written ones as "},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing runs if the entity lacks one of the components. A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentModified"},{"type":"text","text":" event is delivered for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written component. The written types must differ from each other, else the access traps. Overloads exist for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"0 to 4 read and 0 to 4 written types, and a parameter pack overload covers more."}]},{"code":["entity.components(Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocity, position in","    position.x += velocity.dx","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Entity/modify(_:_:)":{"type":"topic","kind"